  m_Name: Ranged_MultiHitVolley_DoubleTap
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Phasix.Runtime::SkillData
  _skillName: Double Tap
  _description: 'Attack Pattern Directive Group 2 - Multi-Hit Volley exploration
    option #2 ("Paired Bursts"). 4 hits instead of 8: N, NE fire as a quick pair,
    then a real pause (long forward-leg on hit 3) before S, SW fire as a second quick
    pair. Hits 1-2 circle marker/left-click, hits 3-4 square marker/right-click.
    Tests whether a shorter, punchier volley with a genuine breathing gap reads better
    than one continuous 8-hit stream.'
